715 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H3 /T (    RAG today encompasses a wide array of techniques, models, and approaches. It can get a little overwhelming for newcomers. As RAG continues to evolve its crucial to create a shared language framework for researchers, practitioners, developers and business leaders.      ) /E (    RAG today encompasses a wide array of techniques, models, and approaches. It can get a little overwhelming for newcomers. As RAG continues to evolve its crucial to create a shared language framework for researchers, practitioners, developers and business leaders.      ) /Alt () /Pg 9 0 R /K [2 ] >> endobj
716 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H3 /T (    This taxonomy is an attempt to clarify the components of RAG, serve as a guide for understanding key building blocks and provide a roadmap to navigate through this, somewhat complex, evolving RAG ecosystem.) /E (    This taxonomy is an attempt to clarify the components of RAG, serve as a guide for understanding key building blocks and provide a roadmap to navigate through this, somewhat complex, evolving RAG ecosystem.) /Alt () /Pg 9 0 R /K [3 ] >> endobj
