741 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H4 /T (Knowledge Cut-off Date: Training an LLM is an expensive and time-consuming process. It takes massive volumes of data and several weeks, or even months, to train an LLM. The data that LLMs are trained on is therefore not current. For example, GPT-4o has knowledge only up to October 2023. Any event that happened after this knowledge cut-off date is not available to the model.) /E (Knowledge Cut-off Date: Training an LLM is an expensive and time-consuming process. It takes massive volumes of data and several weeks, or even months, to train an LLM. The data that LLMs are trained on is therefore not current. For example, GPT-4o has knowledge only up to October 2023. Any event that happened after this knowledge cut-off date is not available to the model.) /Alt () /Pg 12 0 R /K [1 2 ] >> endobj
