866 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H1 /T (A SIMPLE GUIDE TO RETRIEVAL AUGMENTED GENERATION) /E (A SIMPLE GUIDE TO RETRIEVAL AUGMENTED GENERATION) /Alt () /Pg 20 0 R >> endobj
867 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H2 /T (Core Components) /E (Core Components) /Pg 20 0 R /K [0 ] >> endobj
