917 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H5 /T (Dense Retrieval: Encode queries and documents as dense vectors for semantic matching. Examples: DPR \(Dense Passage Retriever\), ANCE, RepBERT) /E (Dense Retrieval: Encode queries and documents as dense vectors for semantic matching. Examples: DPR \(Dense Passage Retriever\), ANCE, RepBERT) /Alt () /Pg 24 0 R /K [4 ] >> endobj
