919 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H5 /T (Cross-Encoder Retrieval: Directly compare query-document pairs using transformer models. Example: BERT-based rerankers) /E (Cross-Encoder Retrieval: Directly compare query-document pairs using transformer models. Example: BERT-based rerankers) /Alt () /Pg 24 0 R /K [6 ] >> endobj
