928 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H3 /T (Augmentation: The process of combining user query and the retrieved documents from the knowledge base.) /E (Augmentation: The process of combining user query and the retrieved documents from the knowledge base.) /Alt () /Pg 25 0 R /K [2 ] >> endobj
929 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H3 /T (Prompt Engineering: The technique of giving instructions to an LLM to attain a desired outcome. The goal of Prompt Engineering is to construct the prompts to achieve accuracy and relevance in the LLM responses with respect to the desired outcome\(s\). ) /E (Prompt Engineering: The technique of giving instructions to an LLM to attain a desired outcome. The goal of Prompt Engineering is to construct the prompts to achieve accuracy and relevance in the LLM responses with respect to the desired outcome\(s\). ) /Alt () /Pg 25 0 R /K [3 ] >> endobj
930 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H3 /T (Contextual Prompting: Adding an instruction like Answer only based on the context provided.Ž to have set up the generation to focus only on the provided information and not from LLMs internal knowledge \(or parametric knowledge\).) /E (Contextual Prompting: Adding an instruction like Answer only based on the context provided.Ž to have set up the generation to focus only on the provided information and not from LLMs internal knowledge \(or parametric knowledge\).) /Alt () /Pg 25 0 R /K [4 ] >> endobj
931 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H3 /T (Controlled Generation Prompting: Adding an instruction like, If the question cannot be answered based on the provided context, say I dont know.Ž to ensure that the model's responses are grounded in the retrieved information) /E (Controlled Generation Prompting: Adding an instruction like, If the question cannot be answered based on the provided context, say I dont know.Ž to ensure that the model's responses are grounded in the retrieved information) /Alt () /Pg 25 0 R /K [5 ] >> endobj
932 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H3 /T (Few Shot Prompting: LLMs adhere quite well to examples provided in the prompt. While providing the retrieved information in the prompt, specifying certain examples to help guide the generation in the way the retrieved information needs to be used.) /E (Few Shot Prompting: LLMs adhere quite well to examples provided in the prompt. While providing the retrieved information in the prompt, specifying certain examples to help guide the generation in the way the retrieved information needs to be used.) /Alt () /Pg 25 0 R /K [6 ] >> endobj
