986 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H5 /T (Mean Reciprocal Rank \(MRR\): Useful in evaluating the rank of the relevant document, it measures the reciprocal of the ranks of the first relevant document in the list of results. MRR is calculated over a set of queries.) /E (Mean Reciprocal Rank \(MRR\): Useful in evaluating the rank of the relevant document, it measures the reciprocal of the ranks of the first relevant document in the list of results. MRR is calculated over a set of queries.) /Alt () /Pg 30 0 R /K [5 ] >> endobj
987 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H5 /T (Mean Average Precision\(MAP\):  A metric that combines precision and recall at different cut-off levels of k i.e. the cut-off number for the top results. It calculates a measure called Average Precision and then averages it across all queries.) /E (Mean Average Precision\(MAP\):  A metric that combines precision and recall at different cut-off levels of k i.e. the cut-off number for the top results. It calculates a measure called Average Precision and then averages it across all queries.) /Alt () /Pg 30 0 R /K [6 ] >> endobj
