1029 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H4 /T (Benchmarks: Standardised datasets and their evaluation metrics used to measure the performance of RAG systems. Benchmarks provide a common ground for comparing different RAG approaches. Benchmarks ensure consistency across the evaluations by considering fixed tasks and evaluation criteria. ) /E (Benchmarks: Standardised datasets and their evaluation metrics used to measure the performance of RAG systems. Benchmarks provide a common ground for comparing different RAG approaches. Benchmarks ensure consistency across the evaluations by considering fixed tasks and evaluation criteria. ) /Alt () /Pg 34 0 R /K [7 ] >> endobj
