1379 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H4 /T (RAFT: Retrieval-Augmented Fine-Tuning combine retrieval mechanisms with traditional fine-tuning techniques to help models access and utilise external knowledge dynamically during their fine-tuning process.) /E (RAFT: Retrieval-Augmented Fine-Tuning combine retrieval mechanisms with traditional fine-tuning techniques to help models access and utilise external knowledge dynamically during their fine-tuning process.) /Alt () /Pg 54 0 R /K [3 4 ] >> endobj
1380 0 obj <</Type /StructElem /S /H4 /T (RAPTOR: Recursive Abstractive Processing for Tree-Organised Retrieval focusses on creating a recursive, tree-like structure from documents to improve context-aware information retrieval. It is beneficial for question-answering tasks, especially when dealing with extensive documents or information that requires multi-step reasoning.) /E (RAPTOR: Recursive Abstractive Processing for Tree-Organised Retrieval focusses on creating a recursive, tree-like structure from documents to improve context-aware information retrieval. It is beneficial for question-answering tasks, especially when dealing with extensive documents or information that requires multi-step reasoning.) /Alt () /Pg 54 0 R /K [5 ] >> endobj
